Parsing config file for zone 0

----------------- Physical Case Definition ( Zone 0 ) -------------------
Compressible Euler equations.
Mach number: 2.
Angle of attack (AoA): 0 deg, and angle of sideslip (AoS): 0 deg.
No restart solution, use the values at infinity (freestream).
Dimensional simulation.
The reference area is 1 m^2.
The semi-span will be computed using the max y(3D) value.
The reference length is 1 m.
Surface(s) where the force coefficients are evaluated and 
their reference origin for moment computation: 
   - upper (0.25, 0, 0).
   - lower (0.25, 0, 0) m.
Surface(s) plotted in the output file: lower.
Surface(s) affected by the design variables: upper, lower, inlet, outlet.
Input mesh file name: mesh_wedge_inv.su2

--------------- Space Numerical Integration ( Zone 0 ) ------------------
HLLC solver for the flow inviscid terms.
Standard Roe without low-dissipation function.
First order integration in space.
Gradient for upwind reconstruction: inverse-distance weighted Least-Squares.
Gradient for viscous and source terms: inverse-distance weighted Least-Squares.

--------------- Time Numerical Integration  ( Zone 0 ) ------------------
Local time stepping (steady state simulation).
Euler implicit method for the flow equations.
BCGSTAB is used for solving the linear system.
Using a ILU(0) preconditioning.
Convergence criteria of the linear solver: 0.1.
Max number of linear iterations: 3.
V Multigrid Cycle, with 3 multigrid levels.
Damping factor for the residual restriction: 0.5.
Damping factor for the correction prolongation: 0.5.
No CFL adaptation.
